  "subject": {
    "id": "cc003-planning-registration",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Register the blocked OD-017 governance epoch workstream and close one stale R02 guard.",
  "why": "OD-017 requires one explicit implementation workstream. The registration records one outcome with four internal slices, preserves the Core compiler and interpreter boundary, and makes CC-R08 completion a mechanical activation prerequisite without authorizing implementation. The same exact integration test file still omitted the private LinkML adapter added to the wheel exclusion list by commit 3a9c42b; this revision aligns that assertion with the already committed packaging boundary without changing package behavior."
}
